      "title": "TAE preview usage",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Kijai MiniMax-H3 TAE live preview\n\n- **ON**: decodes 12 evenly spaced RGB frames at every sampling step\n- **OFF**: lazy branch skips the TAE node and matches the baseline path\n- Model: `taeh3.safetensors`\n- Preview: max 512 px / JPEG 80 / 12 frames at 12 fps\n\nThe final video still uses the regular MiniMax-H3 Video VAE."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
    {
      "id": 116,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        -2973.522222222217,
