      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Note: MiniMax H3",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## MiniMax H3 R2V Turbo — RTX 3060 template\n\n- Diffusion model: `minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors`\n- References: `<Picture 1>` and `<Picture 2>`\n- References guide identity/style; they are not guaranteed first frames\n- Reference image size: `match` (recommended for 12 GB VRAM)\n- LoRA: `minimax_h3_turbo_4step_ema_ckpt850_pruned_comfyui.safetensors`\n- LoRA strength: 1.0\n- Video / audio sigma shift: 12 / 5\n- Sampling: 8 steps, `res_multistep`, scheduler `simple`\n- EasyCache: bypassed for the Turbo baseline\n- Output size: Resolution Selector, 0.40 MP / multiple of 32\n- Duration: 5 seconds / 124 frames / 24 fps\n- TAE preview and generated audio can be toggled independently\n- Launch with `Run-MiniMax-H3.bat` for SageAttention\n\nPrompt reference tags must match the connected order exactly. Additional image/video/audio sockets can be added from the R2V node."
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
